@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This Student Service Request System is developed for educational purposes as part of CSC 439 - Visual Programming course at IUBAT.</p>

<h3>Data Collection</h3>
<p>The system collects the following information:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Student/Staff name and email address (for account creation)</li>
    <li>Service request details (type, description)</li>
    <li>Request status and timestamps</li>
</ul>

<h3>Data Usage</h3>
<p>Collected data is used solely for:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Processing service requests</li>
    <li>Communication regarding request status</li>
    <li>System administration and auditing</li>
</ul>

<h3>Data Protection</h3>
<p>All data is stored securely using ASP.NET Core Identity with hashed passwords. Database connections use SSL encryption.</p>

<h3>Contact</h3>
<p>For privacy concerns, contact the course instructor: Md. Asif Hossain</p>